As you learn to tiptoe across the veil of death you learn to master the dark forces.

Each time you cross the 1 life threshold you automatically unleash a blast of [159, 214, 257, 293, 325 (TL1-5; SP 100)] frostdusk damage in radius [1, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)].

For each creature that takes damage from the blast one of your talent's cooldown is reduced by [2, 4, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
